   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Thanks for the reply Eric, perhaps we should stick with the tried and true geographic stratification- the survey was designed with equal coverage probability for the entire study area but weather resulted in differing amounts of effort per survey. We do not have enough replicates when split by season to use this strat option. I&#39;m wondering why effort_sum is used so infrequently? <div>Thanks,<br><div>Janet<br><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
