    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>Thanks for the reply Eric, perhaps we should stick with the tried and true geographic stratification- the survey was designed with equal coverage probability for the entire study area but weather resulted in differing amounts of effort per survey. We do\r\n not have enough replicates when split by season to use this strat option. I&#39;m wondering why effort_sum is used so infrequently? \r\n<div>Thanks,<br>\r\n<div>Janet<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">On Wednesday, February 4, 2026 at 2:40:31 AM UTC-8 Eric Rexstad wrote:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nJanet</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThis is a stratification option that is seldom exercised so I can&#39;t swear that all daemons have been exorcised from this section of code.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nI&#39;ve done a scan of our Github issues for occurrences of &quot;effort_sum&quot;. I see no mention of it in any open issues. Most activity around this dates back to June 2021, when there were several code modifications and the issue was closed. This form of stratification\r\n was disabled in December 2022 when used in conjunction with multiple detection functions.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nMy memory does not bring to mind any more recent discussions or activity regarding &quot;effort_sum&quot;.</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-size:11pt\"><b>From:</b>\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of Janet Mossman &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">pacif...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> 03 February 2026 22:54<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> distance-sampling &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [distance-sampling] any current errors associated with dht2 effort_sum stratification</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" align=\"left\" style=\"background:revert!important;border:revert!important;color:revert!important;direction:revert!important;display:revert!important;font-size:revert!important;height:revert!important;letter-spacing:revert!important;line-height:revert!important;margin:revert!important;opacity:revert!important;outline:revert!important;overflow:revert!important;padding:revert!important;table-layout:revert!important;text-align:revert!important;text-indent:revert!important;text-orientation:revert!important;text-overflow:revert!important;text-transform:revert!important;vertical-align:revert!important;white-space:revert!important;width:revert!important;word-break:revert!important;word-spacing:revert!important;writing-mode:revert!important;zoom:revert!important;border:0!important;display:table!important;width:100%!important;table-layout:fixed!important;border